CORE
assignment_lhs_read.c
--evaluation-order-check
^\[main\.evaluation-order\.1\] line 12 value of (\([^)]*\))?i is independent of evaluation order: FAILURE$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The evaluations of the left-hand side and of the right-hand side of an
assignment are unsequenced, so the index i of a[i] may be read before or after
the call to f, which modifies i.
